This product is a clean-room implementation, written solely from the following
published research papers and its authors' own design:

  - "TurboQuant: Online Vector Quantization with Near-optimal Distortion Rate"
    Amir Zandieh, Majid Daliri, Majid Hadian, Vahab Mirrokni (Google Research)
    arXiv:2504.19874 — https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.19874

  - "RaBitQ: Quantizing High-Dimensional Vectors with a Theoretical Error Bound
    for Approximate Nearest Neighbor Search"
    arXiv:2405.12497 — https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.12497 (SIGMOD 2024)

quantvec is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Google or the
